age (grid or list, create, delete, a detail view), use that component rather than this list."],[31,"Clicking a value in the \"Sources\" facet applies a filter to the shared query state (and the URL) — it does not run\nthe search: nothing in the library does, so a real page watches the URL or the store and calls\n`QueryService.search()` itself, as Who runs the search shows. The sample\nabove only searches when the input changes. See Filtering\nresults for facet types, controlled mode and custom item templates, and\nQuery for paging, running several queries in parallel, and telling a failed request\napart from a genuine zero-match."],[2694,"Close the parent dialog from a projected sub-component — `DIALOG_REF`"],[496,"Collections"],[516,"Collections & labels"],[460,"Collections manager"],[679,"Colour comes from a **primitive** galactik token (`--blue-500`), resolved once after the first render — reading\nit any earlier returns nothing useful, since `getComputedStyle` has nothing to compute against before styles\napply. A primitive token is invariant across themes, which is why the ramp keeps its identity when the page\nflips to dark mode, unlike the semantic tokens (axis text, grid lines) the Chart.js-based charts use instead."],[1029,"Colour family of the pill."],[652,"Comparing two periods"],[2964,"Components for moving around inside an application: a styled anchor, a tabbed panel switcher, and a\ncollapsible app-shell navigation panel with a built-in mobile drawer."],[2761,"Components that float above the page — Dialog, Sheet, Menu, Popover, Tooltip — and the tokens and layering rules they share."],[2426,"Compose a status Badge with a user avatar, as shown above."],[2691,"Compose all six slots, and the three open modes"],[1097,"Composing the provider list yourself"],[2284,"Conditional trailing content needs the `slot=\"trailing\"` marker on an `<ng-container>` wrapping the block —\nAngular only hoists a block's marker onto the block itself when it has a single root 