board as usual each time it takes the focus, and a hardware keyboard types in it all the same. Nothing changes\nwith a mouse or on a phone held upright (and the plain bar, which has no popup, never shows the button)."],[2304,"In landscape the on-screen keyboard of an iPad covers half of the screen, and the popup of its suggestions is left with a sliver to\nshow itself in. While the page is driven with a finger and the screen is landscape, the field gets a keyboard button: it puts\nthe keyboard away while the field keeps the focus and its popup stays open, and brings it back at the next tap. The field\nopens its keyboard as usual each time it takes the focus, and a hardware keyboard types in it all the same. Nothing changes\nwith a mouse or on a phone held upright (and the plain field, which has no popup, never shows the button)."],[487,"In the detail of a collection, tick documents and choose &#x2A;*Move to…**: the panel lists the other collections, and\noffers to create one. The documents are added to the chosen collection first, then taken out of the source, so a\nfailure never loses them."],[455,"In the external authentication modes (`sso`, `oauth`, `saml`, `bearer`), Sign In starts the\nhandshake as soon as it mounts. Rendering the sign-in form on `/logout` would therefore re-authenticate the\nuser immediately — a spinner that loops straight back in, defeating the logout. This view breaks that loop."],[287,"In the list"],[998,"In the popover each facet keeps its header (its title and the chevron that collapses and expands it), without a border\nbetween two facets. Under the search field of an open facet sits the same bar as in a filter button's popover:\n**Clear all** and **Apply**, with a **Select all** row above the items of a list or tree facet; a date facet, which has no\nsearch field, shows the bar at its top. The trigger reads\n\"More\" (`filters.more`; \"Plus\" in French, \"Mehr\" in German), and its accessible name stays \"More filters\"."],[2228,"Indepe