ns list with keyboard\nnavigation."],[2724,"Use a real `<dialog>` tag when you want a genuinely backdrop-less, `Escape`-inert non-modal window; use\n`openModal()` (which forces `isModal` unconditionally) when you want a `[dialog]` host to never close on a\nbackdrop click."],[1126,"Use another endpoint path, or opt in per environment"],[2021,"Use the state with no component of ours"],[1958,"Use the workspaces view, the save-to-workspace picker and the mention list from a page that is not Angular, as custom elements with a prebuilt stylesheet."],[1627,"User profile"],[1761,"User settings"],[1704,"Users can…"],[1636,"Users edit values, not structures"],[546,"Using the form outside a dialog"],[2590,"Utilities that sit outside any single component family — a signal answering a structural, non-CSS question\nabout the current viewport."],[1654,"Value"],[1702,"Value"],[2145,"Variants, sizes and icon-only"],[3023,"Vertical orientation"],[828,"Visible with a dimmed, non-expandable header by default; hidden too when `[hideWhenEmpty]=\"true\"`"],[1238,"Warn before the session expires"],[132,"What \"Add to collection\" actually does with the selected documents."],[1639,"What a row tells the user"],[947,"What a single button in the bar opens, and how its popover sizes itself to the viewport."],[2043,"What a template reference (`#ws=\"workspaceMention\"`) or `injectWorkspaceMention()` gives:"],[880,"What a user can filter on — the counterpart this component's chips come\nfrom."],[924,"What actually renders inside the popover."],[1634,"What each kind of value becomes"],[1411,"What goes there"],[949,"What the bar's siblings show once a filter from it is actually applied."],[908,"What the popover holds"],[982,"What the query is currently filtered by — one removable chip per value."],[2010,"What the upload button and the tracker do."],[8,"What this library is not"],[38,"What this library is not"],[2836,"What this library is, and how it relates to atomic-angular."],[2740,"What this lib